\ Same word-body shape as word_body_nonprelude_reach, built strict. The
\ strict promoting walks do not promote the `@get call` shape, so the
\ interpreted-reach detection is the backstop: the build must fail with the
\ --emit-runtime-image diagnostic instead of trapping at runtime.
use { floor: } "math" ;
runner: ( x -- y ) [ H{ go: [ floor ] } go: @get call ] ;
3.7 runner
.
